  monsterId: 4b898978274b42febeae3e2de1c85f62
  displayName: Rathive Praetorian
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6eea0b9c791a87149a94b8d8a6d17a49, type: 3}
  description: The Rathive Praetorians are elite ratkin soldiers, sworn to protect
    their queen, roughly human-sized, built lean and corded with muscle. A thick
    tail trails behind them and flicks with irritation like a whip. They move at
    a disciplined steady pace, neither skittering nor lumbering. They speak in clipped
    speech - commands, warnings, and harsh, military jargon - often while advancing
    in formation.
